  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Fixed\n- Package updates now pick the highest version using SemVer-aware comparison, so a stable release is no longer replaced by a prerelease of the same version\n- Mirror folders are now copied correctly when the work folder is passed as a relative path (#235)\n### Changed\n- Dependencies - Updated CSharpier to 1.4.0\n- Dependencies - Updated SonarAnalyzer.CSharp to 10.36.0.15337\n- Dependencies - Updated xunit.analyzers to 2.3.0\n- Dependencies - Updated xunit.v3 to 4.0.3\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.Extensions.Linq to 1.0.165.2159\n- Dependencies - Updated Microsoft.Extensions to 11.0.0\n- Dependencies - Updated NuGet to 8.0.0\n- Target .NET 11 (SDK 11.0.100-rc.3.26522.148) and enable runtime-async\n- Dependencies - Updated Meziantou.Analyzer to 3.0.340\n- Dependencies - Updated Philips.CodeAnalysis.MaintainabilityAnalyzers to 2.2.0\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.Enumeration to 1.2.159.2554\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.ChangeLog to 1.10.216.2909\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.CodeAnalysis to 7.2.28.2699",
